{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_26312","headline":"夜宴曲 · 施肩吾","name":"夜宴曲","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"兰缸如昼晓不眠，玉堂夜起沈香烟。\n青娥一行十二仙，欲笑不笑桃花然。\n碧窗弄娇梳洗晚，户外不知银汉转。\n被郎嗔罚琉璃盏，酒入四肢红玉软。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"施肩吾","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_26312.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_26312","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"乐府","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}